cx:deuNHD_QuotativeconditionalWennSiesagenXdannY_Meaning a rcxn:ConstructionMeaning ;
    rcxn:hasMeaning "The speaker (doctor) quotes [the listener (patient)]2 with [something they have said or may say]4, thereby assigning a stance to them that is followed up with [a suggested conclusion]6 that both interactants may relate to in the further discussion of a medical decision" .

